Package: levyfit
Title: Maximum Likelihood Estimation for Levy Degradation Processes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amedée Rytrace", "Tito", , "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christian", "Paroissin", , "christian.paroissin@univ-pau.fr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation of the parameters of
    degradation models based on Levy processes (Wiener, gamma, inverse
    Gaussian, variance-gamma and Meixner processes) from one or several
    trajectories observed at possibly irregular inspection times.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/rytracetito/levy_packages/tree/main/levyfit, https://github.com/rytracetito/levy_packages
